# Repo-root ignores. Tool-local ignores (.venv, __pycache__, fixture scratch)
# live in tools/.gitignore and stay there.

# Reference imagery for the source-driven map pipeline. Local-only by decision:
# third-party IP (GW cartography, a Total War screenshot mosaic, fan maps) plus
# ~40 MB of binaries. NEVER committed. What IS committed in its place:
#   - tools/SOURCES.md            (filename + dims + SHA-256 + origin + role)
#   - tools/registration/*.json   (projection, control points, crop, footprint)
# so the exact inputs behind every committed bitmap stay auditable without
# shipping the art. See planning/requests/world-map-source-driven.md (decision #2)
# and tools/PROVENANCE.md.
sources/

*.log
*.bak

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
*$py.class

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# maestro skills scratch copies of workspecs
planning/.cache/
